# BookStore API

A simple Book Store REST API built with ASP.NET Core Web API.

This project is created for practicing fundamental ASP.NET Core concepts such as:
- Routing
- HTTP Methods
- Model Binding
- Model Validation
- LINQ
- Status Codes
- CRUD Operations

## Technologies

- ASP.NET Core Web API
- C#
- .NET
- Swagger / OpenAPI

## Features

- Get all books
- Get a book by ID
- Create a new book
- Update a book completely using PUT
- Update part of a book using PATCH
- Delete a book
- Search books using Query Parameters
- Handle HTTP Status Codes

